<title>DENMARK: SAS sees '97 full-year result like '96.</title>
<headline>SAS sees '97 full-year result like '96.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airlines System (SAS) on Tuesday maintained expectations of a 1997 full-year pre-tax profit similar to 1996's 1.815 billion Swedish crowns, despite posting first quarter 1997 losses.</p>
</text>
